      "The campaign leverages local pride and global reach, creating a strong emotional connection with the audience.",
      "Utilizing pop-up events and tastings is an effective way to engage the community and provide tangible experiences of the product.",
      "The title 'Gusto Local, Impacto Global' effectively communicates the campaign's core message of local flavors making a global impact, which is catchy and memorable."
    ],
    "Weaknesses": [
      "The campaign might face criticism for promoting a global brand over local businesses, potentially alienating a segment of the target audience who prefer supporting local enterprises.",
      "Depending on the execution, there could be a perceived lack of authenticity, especially if the local flavors are significantly altered or if the global impact is overstated.",
      "The campaign's success heavily relies on the execution of the events and tastings, which could be logistically challenging and expensive."
    ]
  },
